#: scenario5:scenario5_DA07594C_05BB_4C6E_90E6_10C58B6D020E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5c21e48f50e0bc0e4a1b46b6ac0dc0693c91c826127aeff2905d23ee27e3707
