msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It would seem you are not aware whose house you’re trying to break into."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫どこに踏み入ろうとしているのか、⟪k:3⟫分かっていないようだな……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eec7bc5c04743097abf059f720751a116c0aefba8840df6ecaf154f5971c88c
#. default-sha256: a129e65c3ac5e2c72d9a57f37ae60fdf33494fc41a73653b50b4842f42e5f074
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The world went silent, like "
"time had come to a stop.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫No one could manage to say a word,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫――時が止まったかのように、"
"⟪k:13⟫静まり返っていた。⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫誰ひとり、⟪k:16⟫言葉を発することが出来ずに……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d581a803c59ab0d0d3ab331c6ad912002ec3354b0375788541c7dbfd5cacd2fb
#. default-sha256: 1be0b230f3f94f80081426fb93e653cc184f09b477b257dbe1b519455bc72e1d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫only stare at the man who had appeared from within the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷の奥から現れた、⟪k:1⟫その男を見ていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca1c6478a7bf78003e2315be403cd18d4f917b3a30358eb9bcc54109d4be2fd4
#. default-sha256: bed170b2d46678fd30352ebfc15404f55b91834ae68811843d58f7da27524ddd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Surely you know what this place is called."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この館が何と呼ばれているのか、⟪k:1⟫知らぬわけではあるまい……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9198B71_C35F_4BD1_84C0_071E80B99ABA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c52d3ff02cdb52032d870f159ff0b86e3ff063f3e73ff660e2d4d7d2e3d4346
