msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9198B71_C35F_4BD1_84C0_071E80B99ABA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Beneath the dazzling midday sun,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫眩しいほどの陽射しに晒されたその人は――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a6d38f3062bb9122e8bcadfa8fbf7889f65b38ad1b14045b3239966d613665c
#. default-sha256: 0cd3ba293fa06d1d984f2bceda256415277a392a64168039020da5934b317c54
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫he had bone-chillingly alabaster skin and long, nearly translucently pale hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫背筋が凍るほどの白い肌をしており、⟪k:1⟫透き通りそうなほどの長い純白の髪を持っていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2D3C3470_7C9F_4431_B67D_D05BDB14A582
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c00141c41a91ec8f7d6152ad56c71e921034be156da9e5e6f0da18d230c1c2
#. default-sha256: f56db61ca3c122163a66abb044ec0beb7939d109e43a469eba143b61b96744d8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2D3C3470_7C9F_4431_B67D_D05BDB14A582"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So surely you came prepared for whatever you would find..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それを知っての上ならば、⟪k:1⟫覚悟は出来ているのだろうな……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D92D32C1_0A19_4E83_8C64_C449FF8172C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54986e3aaadc5283689bbf626c992dfa0cb242c22dfca0645a1dc00d73d12e1c
#. default-sha256: 6d7ca8e3191df18fa330c198361f92be3035edd2f96e8141f24333a6fe745d5f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D92D32C1_0A19_4E83_8C64_C449FF8172C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And his eyes..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫その人が睥睨する眼差しは――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D8D799E7_FF18_48BA_B6E3_2BE52A033C20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4b0c57283a7d231ce24a0b8a16db1122a7ad130fee6d94bff221d112fc36eba
