msgid "⟪k:0⟫Demon? ⟪k:1⟫Him? ⟪k:2⟫Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫悪魔……？　⟪k:1⟫あの人――、⟪k:2⟫……ミシェルが？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_29464700_1C60_48FD_9C75_F3152E457AF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcb75d77f4cfa4c1e20c6995e1befb27d42424502c04e2653db314d40f7b4e56
#. default-sha256: 15ac574c622e77c74a7fcc114ab76e82ade3a766a958fa667ebe52d7b5cfadba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_29464700_1C60_48FD_9C75_F3152E457AF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No, he’s not curs—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ち……、⟪k:1⟫ちがうわ、⟪k:2⟫彼は、⟪k:3⟫呪われてなんか――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_AE7C1CB4_95F7_4057_8995_BE29E66375D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6dc732543b59c86c080f98a991eb70945e498ab4f9951ec6cdf8a0fa5bec8a8
#. default-sha256: 073998550de4e2329f0bdb069890c509a95590447fb0f6650f0d0f3a150f9b01
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AE7C1CB4_95F7_4057_8995_BE29E66375D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Indeed! I am cursed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ああ、⟪k:3⟫そうだ！　⟪k:4⟫私は呪われている！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb8d97258ed07e5f99cd13eac8af15777f2194ed2de1e83ec7dff306ea355fc3
#. default-sha256: 143de9837ca17b1725c579a46e7ace0ba97800c9f792e2435678ead627d1de23
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The witch’s curse is real!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I have "
"inherited it, in its entirety—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫as well as her purpose!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫魔女の呪いは実在する！　⟪k:9⟫魔女の意志を、⟪k:10⟫すべ"
"ての呪いを、⟪k:11⟫私が引き継いだのだから！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E59C58D1_E3D3_41A7_B771_B1C16E79855D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44f56880367417c315f12fabc5f5203861ae28024ab61561d26fac886d7b9b15
#. default-sha256: e191a1c753a7e55276713141e72d6f0cb6c7be80b9e2fd303d24183a1d623e0b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E59C58D1_E3D3_41A7_B771_B1C16E79855D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………ッ！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0CB33A79_4C6F_4949_B116_CA3F9D4681BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bfcf1683bed7c30ef46d619d78dd550a3b1f60711ba07151cf831dc51b01b94
#. default-sha256: d7539cd479606cf97bc8374118570f9da493521f41c98ba1ed6d955498a63ae7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0CB33A79_4C6F_4949_B116_CA3F9D4681BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A witch, a demon, a spirit impure!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Call me whatever you wish!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魔女とでも、⟪k:1⟫悪魔とでも、⟪k:2⟫不浄の者とでも、⟪k:3⟫何とでも呼ぶといい！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D949
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51492e8ca7433309ae47e318272f6a8fb78a8b80102882316b9c59f760601acd
#. default-sha256: 2061bb5aa520330d1e681c6509ac3ed802fb9df6578af5b2380105065e84ca15
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D949"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the truth shall not change!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I carry within me an eternal curse!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この身が果てしない呪いを宿していることだけが、⟪k:1⟫ただひとつの事実！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB95D949
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f21890f21c861a8d276a31d6312c89120b5333d554e521673ba48e6ec3dbf58
#. default-sha256: 9cd62c118517506a7cfc7bf45078738d3a220bb4c1bdb561d3414acd60774480
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB95D949"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Behold my flesh, pale as the moon!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No red blood flows beneath this skin, as it does "
"yours!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫見よ、⟪k:1⟫この血の通わぬ青白い肌を！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私の皮膚の下には、⟪k:4⟫お前たちと同等の赤い血"
"は流れておらぬ！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c356dc030e66e4a2f9a74e57e1b76fd9dc7bdf94a112b6772c52a3f952a9edd
#. default-sha256: 2d65fe1bc433dff5f0f16d20068fa9e646d3b47d13a360448f112f25b676c522
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Behold my hair, utterly devoid of color,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫offered up to the Devil as part of our "
"pact!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫見よ、⟪k:1⟫この色の失われた白き髪を！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私はすべての色を差し出すことで、⟪k:4⟫悪魔との"
"契約を果たした！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1b061e98cadc84a2ca12215e168cf4409ed44243e1fa2735dc2a74a08140c69
#. default-sha256: b04977b639d786cbac79226c9b04f15a1f38698d14e825ea1268f97837dfb6e7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D999"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Behold these crimson eyes!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A symbol of the lifeblood spilt at my hands!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫見よ、⟪k:1⟫この赤い瞳を！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫これこそ……私の奪った数々の命が流し続けたその色の証！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acb4eb5bea9aaab74a54d4c6bd3feb7858385bb650f93d817ce94b4a5b741640
#. default-sha256: e8020fc8fb29ac30873e375358f70af2138e3237503f684fb84d40884f9318ce
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D849"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫aaah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あ……、⟪k:1⟫ああ………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E22FD1CE_DC1F_4F16_898F_96EFD80B6207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fad61383a5e07fbd031f231ce08292452596f010781ebc26302faa339a53847
#. default-sha256: fa7c2ca72bf2ee3b9227fe0c88f9f48fd2fd5d5de6dd8a8825f97eb05be8bdd0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E22FD1CE_DC1F_4F16_898F_96EFD80B6207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I shall bring calamity upon you, as the witch of legend!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫言い伝えのように――お前たちに災いをもたらしてやろう！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5DDA295_5464_46AA_A330_C83F64301F84
